      'vinland-saga', 'vinland-saga', 'Vinland Saga', 'ヴィンランド・サガ', 2019, 48, 'Finished Airing',
      9.5, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4N3kX2V6wD0sI7QvR0vGj4lM9W2.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5MAq48e77aP78s2C3sZl8Xm3J8d.jpg', 'Jan 22, 2024', 'Sep 30, 2024',
      'watched', 2, 1, 'Raised by the Vikings who murdered his father, young Thorfinn dedicates his life to dueling their leader Askeladd in an insatiable quest for revenge.',
      'vinland-saga', 2,
      NULL, NULL,
      'Vinland Saga', 'ヴィンランド・サガ', 'Makoto Yukimura', 'Manga',
      '28+ Volumes (Ongoing / Near Climax)', 'Ongoing', 'Ongoing Adaptation',
      'Anime adapts Chapters 1 through 100 (Volumes 1–14).', 'To continue reading after Season 2, start at Chapter 101 (Eastern Expedition Arc).',
      NULL, NULL,
      'True Strength & Empathy', 'Revenge leaves you empty. True strength isn’t holding a sharper blade — it is having the courage to refuse violence and choose empathy even when striking is easiest.'
