      9.1, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b5rX1b9dC1E8OQ102F3J2lT2YtN.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pBqg8G1f0M3Vw6c3qJ1iK7y5W4D.jpg', 'Feb 01, 2024', 'Oct 15, 2024',
      'watched', 0, 1, 'Kyotaro Ichikawa, an antisocial middle schooler with bizarre murder fantasies, discovers that the popular school idol Anna Yamada is surprisingly quirky, hungry, and oblivious.',
      'dangers-in-my-heart', 2,
