      'The Dangers in My Heart', '僕の心のヤバイやつ', 'Norio Sakurai', 'Manga',
      '10+ Volumes (Ongoing)', 'Ongoing', 'Ongoing Adaptation',
      'Seasons 1 & 2 adapt Chapters 1 through 113 (Volume 8).', 'Read from Chapter 114 to continue the story in high school.',
      NULL, NULL,
      'Vulnerability Over Defensive Armor', 'Vulnerability is not weakness. Real connection only begins when we drop the defensive armor and risk looking foolish in front of someone we care about.'
