      'apothecary-diaries', 'the-apothecary-diaries', 'The Apothecary Diaries', '薬屋のひとりごと (Kusuriya no Hitorigoto)', 2023, 24, 'Ongoing',
      9, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gL0s3k3zOQ7y9wP4rW6V8Y0Z2N2.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/8wW1qP8wW2yT8wM9aY7uO2yM4n8.jpg', 'Feb 15, 2024', 'Nov 03, 2024',
      'watched', 0, 1, 'Kidnapped and sold into the imperial palace, an eccentric apothecary with a taste for poisons solves medical mysteries that threaten royal consorts.',
      'apothecary-diaries', 1,
      'Witty, Beautifully Crafted Palace Intrigue', '["Maomao is instantly one of my favorite female protagonists in recent memory. She is unapologetically cynical, pragmatic, and obsessed with poison and medicinal herbs, which makes watching her untangle imperial palace conspiracies endlessly entertaining.","Some of the court politics and clan rivalries can get a bit dense in the middle episodes, but the gorgeous art direction and the hilarious dynamic between Maomao and Jinshi keep the momentum fresh throughout."]',
      'The Apothecary Diaries', '薬屋のひとりごと', 'Natsu Hyuuga (Novel), Nekokurage (Manga)', 'Light Novel & Manga',
      '15+ Light Novel Volumes', 'Ongoing', 'Ongoing Adaptation',
      'Season 1 covers Light Novel Volumes 1 & 2 (Manga Chapters 1–40).', 'Season 2 begins at Light Novel Volume 3.',
      NULL, NULL,
      NULL, NULL
    );
