      'kaguya-sama', 'kaguya-sama-love-is-war', 'Kaguya-sama: Love Is War', 'かぐや様は告らせたい ～天才たちの恋愛頭脳戦～', 2019, 37, 'Finished Airing',
      9.4, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dqZENchTd7lp5zht7BdlqM7RBhD.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/pBqg8G1f0M3Vw6c3qJ1iK7y5W4D.jpg', 'Jan 12, 2024', 'Sep 10, 2024',
      'watched', 0, 0, 'Two genius student council leaders are too proud to confess their feelings, turning daily high school interactions into elaborate psychological warfare to force the other to confess first.',
      'kaguya-sama', 4,
      'Peak Romantic Comedy with Genuinely Historic Payoffs', '["Most rom-com anime suffer from endless status quo stagnation, but Kaguya-sama actually evolves. The psychological mind games start as brilliant slapstick comedy, and over three seasons develop into genuine, mature emotional vulnerability.","The dual confession climax in Season 3 Ultra Romantic is one of the most satisfying romantic payoffs I have ever watched. The narrator’s comedic delivery alone makes this an essential watch."]',
